        {
            "title": "美軍在英國RAF Lakenheath基地擊退無人機，伊朗疑涉其中",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"757\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/08913412a1426dcebfdd7efc4d514ad9eec037c9c0240031cf3215cf2d6711b6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA9R0E6_M.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 據《金融時報》週六引述知情人士報導，美軍本月初在英國皇家空軍拉肯希思基地（RAF Lakenheath）成功擊退多架無人機，伊朗被懷疑與此事件有所關聯。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">由於這批無人機未被英美人員尋獲，其來源及與德黑蘭的潛在關聯至今仍存疑問。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">英國國防部確認，英國警方及美國空軍安全人員已就該軍事基地出現未經授權無人機活動的報告作出回應。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">國防部發言人表示，事件已迅速得到處理，基地已恢復正常安全及防衛措施。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-cbec6974-391a-37c5-b148-196d04c52a77-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國空軍此前確認，事件期間沒有任何人員、飛機或基礎設施受到影響。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">白宮及五角大樓未有即時回應置評請求。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次事件發生前，另一座由美國空軍使用的英國軍事基地——皇家空軍費爾福德基地（RAF Fairford）早前亦曾遭遇安全威脅。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">美國總統唐納德·特朗普上月表示，今年9月費爾福德基地疑似遭受伊朗相關威脅，促使美方將軍用飛機轉移他處。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">德黑蘭否認與費爾福德事件有任何關聯，並拒絕承認在英國境內從事其他敵對活動的指控。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">多年來，英國當局多次指控伊朗策劃針對異見人士、以色列人及英國境內猶太裔目標的陰謀及暗殺行動。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次事件發生之際，德黑蘭與華盛頓之間的緊張局勢持續升溫，針對美國軍事設施的疑似威脅已蔓延至中東地區以外。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">目前，伊朗是否涉及拉肯希思事件尚未得到證實。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E7%BE%8E%E8%BB%8D%E5%9C%A8%E8%8B%B1%E5%9C%8Braf-lakenheath%E5%9F%BA%E5%9C%B0%E6%93%8A%E9%80%80%E7%84%A1%E4%BA%BA%E6%A9%9F-%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97%E7%96%91%E6%B6%89%E5%85%B6%E4%B8%AD-100137535.html",
            "pub_date": "2026-11-28 18:06:35",
            "source": "yahoo_finance_asia",
            "kind": 1,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "野村重申「這幾檔」台股「買入」評級！看好2027年AI伺服器市場、上調營收預估",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"676\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9f21f655e39c7794967ebf3658db6755646ffb8ff200d909266185df55ea8df0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fca%2Fcnyes_hk_559%2F0de7ade9e311a1ddf740b1a3c774f145.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/></div></figure></div>",
            "link": "https://hk.news.yahoo.com/%E9%87%8E%E6%9D%91%E9%87%8D%E7%94%B3-%E9%80%99%E5%B9%BE%E6%AA%94-%E5%8F%B0%E8%82%A1-%E8%B2%B7%E5%85%A5-%E8%A9%95%E7%B4%9A-091003932.html",
