        {
            "title": "中國1至10月進口物流需求年減0.6%",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"中國私人製造業8月擴張加速，RatingDog PMI創兩個月新高\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"675\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/af53dc4b6004b7272610c648dd4703ef14a1304da2f53837ccef842c6403762a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w1200%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEBBF0W0_M.jpg\" width=\"1200\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:1200px\">中國私人製造業8月擴張加速，RatingDog PMI創兩個月新高</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><strong>Investing.com -</strong> 受國內需求持續疲軟拖累，原油及成品油進口量下滑，中國進口物流需求在2026年首10個月進一步收縮。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">根據中國物流與採購聯合會週六公佈的數據，今年1至10月進口物流需求按年下降0.6%，跌幅較前9個月的0.2%進一步擴大。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">最新數據顯示，進口物流需求自年初以來持續惡化。今年1至2月，進口物流需求曾錄得9.6%的年增長。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此後增速明顯放緩，上半年增幅收窄至2.2%，至前三季度已轉為負增長。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-5aa2d06a-ddb0-30ea-b2f1-fcc9c6010943-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">能源產品表現尤為疲弱，今年首10個月原油進口物流量按年下跌15.1%。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">同期成品油進口物流量跌幅更為顯著，達20.6%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">能源相關進口的低迷，與科技產品的強勁增長形成鮮明對比——1至10月高科技產品進口金額按年大幅增長44.4%。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">上述數據揭示出中國各進口板塊之間的分化趨勢：石油相關物流量持續下滑，而先進科技產品的進口支出則大幅攀升。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">中國經濟持續承壓，國內需求不振及房地產市場長期低迷，對整體經濟表現構成拖累。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">出口方面則保持相對韌性，在國內經濟活動復甦動力不足之際，為這個全球第二大經濟體提供了一定支撐。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">進口物流需求跌幅持續擴大，令外界對中國國內經濟復甦能否在邁入2027年前重拾動能愈發感到憂慮。</p></div>",
